      transition: all 0.5s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 支援滑鼠懸停 (Hover) 與手機點擊 (Active) */
  .spoiler-image:hover img,
  .spoiler-image.active img {
      filter: none;
  }
</style>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title>就算……</title><link>http://localhost:1313/posts/although/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 05:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/although/</guid><description>&lt;p>就算只寫一行，還是有人會看。&lt;/p></description><content:encoded>&lt;p>就算只寫一行，還是有人會看。&lt;/p>
